    <fr:title text="SQL">SQL</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Term</fr:taxon>
    <fr:meta name="external">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SQL</fr:meta>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>SQL, or “Structured Query Language”, is a family of languages used to declaratively access relational databases.</html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
